{"question": "Find dy/dx when y = (2x + 1)^5", "groups": [{"id": "line1", "say": "We're given y equals two x plus one, all to the power five."}, {"id": "line2", "say": "Bracket to a power? Let u be the inside. So y is just u to the five."}, {"id": "line3", "say": "Differentiate each part. dy by du is five u to the power four. du by dx is two."}, {"id": "line4", "say": "Chain rule: multiply them. Then put the inside back."}, {"id": "answer", "say": "So dy by dx is ten, times two x plus one, to the power four."}, {"id": "annot", "say": "That multiply step is the chain rule. Every time."}], "strokes": [{"group": "line1", "d": "M 80 117 Q 83 129 89 138 Q 92 131 95 118 M 89 138 Q 87 147 81 150"}, {"group": "line1", "d": "M 109 127 L 132 127 M 109 137 L 132 137"}, {"group": "line1", "d": "M 150 107 Q 140 125 150 147"}, {"group": "line1", "d": "M 161 120 Q 166 111 175 115 Q 182 119 178 126 Q 175 131 162 140 Q 171 138 182 140"}, {"group": "line1", "d": "M 191 119 L 211 140 M 211 119 L 191 140"}, {"group": "line1", "d": "M 222 129 L 247 129 M 234 117 L 234 141"}, {"group": "line1", "d": "M 259 122 Q 264 119 268 115 L 268 140 M 259 140 L 277 140"}, {"group": "line1", "d": "M 286 107 Q 296 125 286 147"}, {"group": "line1", "d": "M 315 100 L 301 100 L 300 107 Q 307 104 312 108 Q 317 114 310 117 Q 304 119 299 114"}, {"group": "line2", "d": "M 83 207 Q 79 229 82 249 Q 83 252 86 250"}, {"group": "line2", "d": "M 94 239 Q 102 233 108 239 Q 105 244 93 244 Q 94 252 103 251 Q 107 250 110 247"}, {"group": "line2", "d": "M 120 216 L 120 246 Q 120 252 128 249 M 113 230 L 129 229"}, {"group": "line2", "d": "M 150 230 Q 149 248 156 250 Q 164 251 166 231 L 166 250"}, {"group": "line2", "d": "M 185 237 L 208 237 M 185 247 L 208 247"}, {"group": "line2", "d": "M 224 230 Q 230 220 239 225 Q 245 230 239 236 L 225 250 Q 235 247 246 250"}, {"group": "line2", "d": "M 255 229 L 275 250 M 275 229 L 255 250"}, {"group": "line2", "d": "M 286 240 L 310 240 M 298 228 L 298 252"}, {"group": "line2", "d":